\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  rupee eases on Asian cues,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fears   \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2007\par 05:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Updates to open)   \par \par \uc2  MUMBAI, Oct 3 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee slipped to its lowest in two weeks on Wednesday, following the lead of other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar ahead of key U.S. data this week, and on concerns about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  At 9:40 a.m. (0410 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 39.860/865 per dollar, off an early low of 39.90 but still lower than Monday's close of 39.85/86. Markets were closed on Tuesday for a holiday.   \par \par \uc2  Last week the rupee rose to a peak of 39.62, its highest since April 1998.   \par \par \uc2  "Rupee shorts are getting covered this morning, and if the RBI comes in it could lose some ground quickly," said a dealer with a state-run bank, referring to the Reserve Bank of India.   \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso shed half a percent and other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  also slipped as market participants halted their selling of dollars ahead of the U.S. data.   \par \par \uc2  The U.S. Institute of Supply Management's indicator on the service sector is due on Wednesday and non-farm payrolls data is due on Friday.   \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they would closely watch the stock market for direction on the rupee. Investment flows have been a key driver of the rupee, which has gained more than 11 percent this year.   \par \par \uc2  The benchmark share index <.BSESN> set a 10th record high in as many days in early trade on Wednesday. Data showed foreigners bought about $3.6 billion in the last eight trading days of September following a cut in U.S interest rates on Sept. 18.   \par \par \uc2  Still, traders remained cautious about provoking the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which they said had been working to stem the rupee's rise.   \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent $38.1 billion in the first seven months of 2007 to check the rupee, the most recent data shows.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -------------------------------------------------------------\par                   MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index         <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)              <INR=IN>\par  -------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA/RUPEE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|RBN|SNI|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020071006e3a30001f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
