\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Bonds Rise On Liquidity; Rupee Dn On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Talk   \b0\par\par\uc2 465 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2007\par 15:32\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    As Of 1200 GMT \par                    Latest     Change \par  USD/INR           39.85      +0.01 \par  7.99% 2017 Bond   7.90%      Unchanged \par  Call Rate         6.10%      -265 BPs \par  Forward Dollar Premium/Discount* \par  September         0.34       -0.04 . \par *Forward Dollar Premium/Discount is midpoint of bid-offer spreads. \par     \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--India government bonds rose Monday as ample liquidity in the financial system overshadowed the impact of additional supply later in the week, while the rupee was hit by suspected \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , market participants said.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 The benchmark 7.49% 2017 bond firmed to close at INR100.58 from the previous close of INR100.57.   \par \par \uc2 "There has been some buying from traders looking for higher yields but gains look limited," said a dealer with a private bank.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to mop up capital inflows have added to liquidity in the financial system.   \par \par \uc2 The RBI releases rupee liquidity into the system when it buys dollars. The RBI received INR304 billion in reverse repo bids as against INR36.65 billion Friday.   \par \par \uc2 However, dealers said that excess liquidity remains a cause of concern as it might result in \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action.   \par \par \uc2 "When liquidity is short, it's a problem and when there is too much liquidity, it's also a problem," the dealer said.   \par \par \uc2 The RBI is scheduled to sell INR40 billion of 5.87% 2010 bonds and INR30 billion of 11.30% 2010 bonds Wednesday   \par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the rupee ended weaker against the dollar on talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar buying late in the session.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar ended at INR39.85 from the previous close of INR39.84.   \par \par \uc2 "The RBI came in toward the later session to prop up the dollar. They must have bought $300 million," said a dealer with a U.S.-based bank.   \par \par \uc2 ICICI Bank expects the dollar to trade in an INR39.50-INR40 band for the week.   \par \par \uc2 "Given the strong initial public offers and follow-on offers pipeline for the next three months, there is bound to be strong appreciation pressure on the rupee in time to come," it said in a note.   \par \par \uc2 Reliance Power, a unit of Reliance Energy Ltd. is expected to hit the markets shortly with an initial public offer, which investment bankers estimate may raise between $2 billion to $3 billion.   \par \par \uc2 Emaar MGF Land Ltd\uc2 , a joint venture between Dubai's  \uc2 Emaar Properties\uc2  and India's MGF Development Ltd., may also raise at least $1 billion.   \par \par \uc2 Indian financial markets are closed Tuesday due to a national holiday. They reopen for usual trading hours Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 -By Subhadip Sircar; Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 22884212; djn.in@dowjones.com [ 01-10-07 1332GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1164 1847 62506   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020071001e3a1000sn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
