\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee inches toward 9-year high on inflows   \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 September 2007\par 05:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Sept 12 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee rose to its highest in over a month on Wednesday, closing in on a nine-year peak, as robust overseas investor inflows outweighed concerns about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 At 9:50 a.m. (0420 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 40.49/50 per dollar, climbing from the previous close of 40.56/57, and moving within sight of a nine-year high of 40.20 hit in July.   \par \par \uc2 "There isn't a negative factor in sight at the moment, and there's little the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can do," said the chief dealer with a corporate, who expects the rupee to trade in a 40.55-40.45 range.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said capital inflows into the stock market, some slated for a share offering by  \uc2 Power Grid Corp of India\uc2 , which aims to raise 30 billion rupees ($740 million), had buoyed the local unit.   \par \par \uc2 A rise in Asian stocks also boosted sentiment for the rupee, with dealers expecting strong investment flows into Indian shares.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar hovered near a record low against the euro, hampered by expectations that the Federal Reserve would start cutting interest rates next week to counter the U.S. economy's slowdown.   \par \par \uc2 Still, the market remained cautious about making large bets on the rupee, wary about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dealers said the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $500 million in the previous session in a bid to stem the rupee's rise.   \par \par \uc2 The rupee has gained more than 9 percent this year to be Asia's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par                  MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index         <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)              <INR=IN>\par  --------------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SNI|ABX|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070915e39c0001t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
