\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rupee nears 9-yr high, cbank blocks-traders   \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2007\par 05:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to open)   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, July 12 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee climbed towards a nine-year high on Thursday, but suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and dollar buying by oil refiners halted its ascent, traders said.   \par \par \uc2 At 10:25 a.m. (0455 GMT), the partially convertible rupee <INR=IN> was at 40.36/37 per dollar -- near a nine-year peak of 40.28 it hit in May. It closed on Wednesday at 40.40/41.   \par \par \uc2 "There was some decent (dollar) buying by state-run banks around 40.36 and it may be on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a local dealer.   \par \par \uc2 Heavy capital inflows have pushed the rupee up by more than 9.5 percent so far in 2007, making it Asia's best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to protect exporters' margins.   \par \par \uc2 Infosys Technologies\uc2  , \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's number-two software exporter, on Wednesday cut its full-year earnings forecast in rupee terms and said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sharp rise was hurting its operating margins.   \par \par \uc2 Foreigners have bought Indian shares worth more than $7.5 billion so far in 2007, compared with $8 billion for the whole of 2006.   \par \par \uc2 Reserve Bank of India Governor Yaga Venugopal Reddy said earlier this month the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was facing severe policy challenges in managing capital flows and analysts expect overseas borrowings to be tightened to help curb inflows.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $2.06 billion through \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in April, taking the total purchases to $24 billion for the six months from November.   \par \par \uc2 It is widely suspected of selling rupees over the past month to keep the dollar above 40 rupees.    \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -----------------------------------------------------------\par                     MARKET SNAPSHOT\par  Bombay Sensitive Index         <.BSESN>\par  Indian rupee (/$)              <INR=IN>\par  -----------------------------------------------------------\par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDIA-RUPEE (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|SNI|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070715e37c0001b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
