\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Down On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\uc2 ; Bonds Higher   \b0\par\par\uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2007\par 15:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                    As Of 1200 GMT \par                    Latest      Change \par  USD/INR           40.49       +0.08 \par  7.49% 2017 Bond   7.91%       -1bp \par  Call Rate         0.50%       -10bps \par  Forward Dollar Premium/Discount* \par    June            0.79       +0.02 . *Forward Dollar Premium/Discount is midpoint of bid-offer spreads. .    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee eased to its lowest level in over a week Thursday as the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was rumored to have aggressively bought dollars to stem the local unit's gains.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at INR40.49, below psychological resistance at INR40.50 but its highest closing since July 3.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that the market was caught unawares by the large \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which some estimate was worth between $300 million and $400 million.   \par \par \uc2 "The RBI has been protecting the dollar at every five paise level over the past several sessions. Today, it aggressively came in to push up the dollar by 30-35 paise," said a dealer with a U.S. based bank.   \par \par \uc2 The rupee's losses were aggravated by companies buying dollars to meet their import requirements, with a large engineering and construction company a major buyer, dealers added.   \par \par \uc2 "The simultaneous buying by state-run banks and the engineering company panicked the market which scrambled to cover shorts," said a dealer with a private bank.   \par \par \uc2 The market is now awaiting cues from the RBI about any possible future moves, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 The federal government has announced certain tax rebates and asked banks to charge a lower interest rate to certain exporters to help them cope with the appreciating rupee.   \par \par \uc2 "There has been some unanticipated appreciation (of Indian rupee) recently," D. Subba Rao, finance secretary said.   \par \par \uc2 However, strong fund flows are expected to continue with local shares again ending at a record high.   \par \par \uc2 The 30-stock Sensex gained 181.42 points, or 1.2%, to end at 15,092.04.   \par \par \uc2 "Every uptick will be sold," said the U.S. bank dealer.   \par \par \uc2 In the government bond market, prices ended higher on hopes that the RBI will hold interest rates steady after data showed that industrial output had slowed in May.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers, however, expect the RBI to announce some bond sales Friday under its market stabilization scheme as the system continues to be flush with funds.   \par \par \uc2 "People are now wary about some imminent steps by the RBI to curb liquidity in the system, especially after they \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market quite heavily earlier today," said a foreign bank dealer.   \par \par \uc2 The most actively traded 7.49% 2017 bond ended at INR97.11, up from INR97.06 at the previous close.   \par \par \uc2 India's industrial output grew by 11.1% on the year in May, slower than 11.7% growth seen in the corresponding month a year ago. Eight economists polled by Dow Jones Newswires had predicted 11.7% growth.   \par \par \uc2 Shubhada Rao, chief economist at Yes Bank, said the data reinforced her belief that the RBI will hold rates at its monetary policy review July 31.   \par \par \uc2 -By Subhadip Sircar; Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 22884212; djn.in@dowjones.com [ 12-07-07 1319GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1164 1847 62506   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070712e37c000ox\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
