\par\par \b \uc2 Indian rate swaps mostly steady despite ample cash   \b0\par\par\uc2 123 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2007\par 11:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, June 20 (Reuters) - Indian rate swaps were almost unchanged on Wednesday as dealers worried the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may take fresh measures to drain ample cash from the banking system.   \par \par \uc2 At 3:15 p.m., the five-year overnight indexed swap was at 7.95/7.97 percent, mostly steady from the previous close of 7.93/7.96 percent.   \par \par \uc2 "It has been a fairly range-bound session. Cash is still more than ample and that is keeping the undertone still bullish," said a local dealer.   \par \par \uc2 Cash supply has increased significantly recently due to federal spending and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.   \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -SWAPS|LANGEN|SNI|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070620e36k000z2\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (india near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrd